0 // Original digital prototype. No physical build, load test, or hardware run.
0 // One SPIKE Prime hub 45601 and three medium angular motors 45603.
0 // A shoulder24:1; B elbow24:1; C gripper1:1. Flexible leads omitted.
0 // X forward, Y down, Z across. 20LDU per stud. Read the illustrated guide.
0 // Reference pose: shoulder45, relative elbow-60, gripper-15 degrees.
0 // The MPD poses each motor rotor separately; the BOM still counts one purchased motor.
0 // Flat form: whole motor shortcuts use their default internal rotor phase. External mechanics are identical.
